Error: Jet.ValueTypeMismatch: `volatile_write` needs a `Ptr<T>`, not Int (a whole number)
  --> Tests/UI/lowlevel_volatile_write_wrong_ptr.jet:4:69
    |
  4 |     #Unsafe("plain ints are not raw pointers") { mem.volatile_write(1, 2) }
    |                                                                     ^
 Why: A volatile write writes through a typed pointer
 Fix: Build a pointer first with `mem.Ptr<T>.from_addr(addr)`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.ValueTypeMismatch
